id: PACK37-1
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: answer_label_required
target: crates/pack/src/validate.rs
find:     out.extend(crate::confirm::check_answer_labels(&pack.scopes));
replace:     out.extend(Vec::<Diagnostic>::new());
expect-fail: pack37_missing_label_is_reported_with_exit_code_1
note: validate が確認 answer の選択肢の label の欠けを検査する呼び出しを外す（label の無い教材パックが validate を通る）
